        <body>
            <div xml:id="d628">

                <pb facs="0736" n="618" xml:id="pg618"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.6363 Barco/109: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Piles</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-07-17T12:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 17,
                                1928—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 10 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>58. I consider the situation to be as set forth by the Department in its 37, July
                    16, 12 noon.</p>
                <p>It is my opinion that the Government will take no action thereon unless pressed.
                    The Foreign Minister is ill. I am trying to see the President and will cable
                    immediately thereafter.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Piles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
